{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "2acd45ba7a058de1a68af6dccbe1befdc43af117d8856ae98023c298127981bb", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}さん！\nわたしのステージ、見てた？　どうだった？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生！\n你有看了我的表演吗？觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3944a9406ee0d6950244b923a44e6e59dbfbb98238aef6255132b2fa05837214", "ja": "あぁ、もちろん見てたよ。\nレッスンの成果、しっかり出せてたな！", "zh": "嗯，我当然看了。\n练习的成果都有展现出来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "f639af9b591353837f190635cd31dd3ee4a5d3297781ad260b77a07514373fe3", "ja": "やったー！　みんなと、\nいっぱいレッスンしたもんね♪", "zh": "太好了──！\n毕竟我和大家做了好多练习嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "cb760d8b5d1d8c4e9c45258c7c958b35e2dcb64b6843dfec4c581c520153144b", "ja": "ちょっと寒かったけど、大きな声で歌えて、\nすーっごく気持ちよかったよ。", "zh": "虽然有点冷，不过能大声唱歌，\n感觉非～常舒服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "898e338c6261dd32a823fbbbfd3a18e2d7bc4ffc861ed6893970445ac91d623d", "ja": "うん。育の楽しいって気持ちが、ステージ袖にも\n十分伝わってきたよ。お客さんにも伝わったと思う。", "zh": "嗯，我在舞台侧边也充分感受到育的快乐心情喔，\n相信观众也都感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "42fd3dbdc7205fc179239a5f132e4f7846fd8d97c07f8a826ac994301e3736c2", "ja": "でも、晴れてたとはいえ寒いからな……\n体が冷える前に、早く着替えてくるといい。", "zh": "不过，现在虽然放晴，但气温还是很低……\n赶紧去换衣服吧，免得着凉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e7baf708d44c488dd7108279f32915d5c1aa0b3e7fdb8ec20607efbd2c23a84", "ja": "あ、わたし知ってる！　桃子ちゃんから聞いたよ。\nたいちょう管理も、仕事のうちなんだよね？", "zh": "啊，这我知道！桃子有跟我说过，\n管理自己的身体健康，也是工作之一对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "4ab142a8dbc07cfa5bc6564d84aa9947eb17e04e27d60a81f5e4bd292c176cb5", "ja": "でも、大丈夫だよ！\n寒いのなんて、へっちゃらだもん。", "zh": "不过，你别担心！\n只不过冷了点，这才不算什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "072a00163d6dc2b6148e487224cf15f9fbf143186b8fe49d21f2dff311d4c215", "ja": "この前、雪がいっぱい積もった日に\n外で遊んでも、ぜんぜん大丈夫だったし♪", "zh": "之前路上积满雪的时候，\n就算到外面玩，我也一点事都没有喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a3e21bf6f9c42d62160eb9ea759c75db2ebd9723aec61c4acf88a906775babb0", "ja": "はは、そうだったな。元気に走り回って雪に\nダイブしてたし。子供は風の子ってやつだな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。那时你活蹦乱跳的，\n还一头栽进雪里面，小孩子就是不怕冷呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "f4c60595b33ca2538a0f5463b42da33c7db12ceee535579b104a0f93069ce237", "ja": "もう、転んだとか言わないで！\nそれから、子どもあつかいもしちゃダメだよ？", "zh": "讨厌，别说什么一头栽进的！\n还有，你也不可以把我当小孩看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3481da2eeaaa07fd53c553a34ad66740a793811f206113fd6e798d10b531a115", "ja": "ごめんごめん。でも育が風邪を引かないか\n心配なんだけど……本当に大丈夫か？", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，但我真的担心育会感冒……\n确定不要紧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "57073ca68d69a7a43130039ed113d93d1725a0c24574f52e8b5121dc09c051a6", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}さん、\n心配してくれてありがとう！", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你这么担心我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "ac7c6f84f397c58e676780bfa8ef27e2ea4c58d31cfc9b86f3376434aebd0e34", "ja": "でも、本当に心配しなくていいよ。\nわたしには、カゼ予防のひさくがあるんだから。", "zh": "但我真的不要紧的。\n我有绝招可以预防感冒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "942be40bb6dbd4d4c4ed00304fe19df7c36e538b9316ab86345e1a169f3e6c25", "ja": "風邪予防の秘策？\nへぇ、どんな事なんだ？", "zh": "有绝招可以预防感冒？\n哦，是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "0d035f4eb4bd0bb59c9c21f8d033af072361000904128d7fedac843138083ca8", "ja": "えへへ、なんだと思う？　当たったら、\n{$P$}さんにも作ってあげる！", "zh": "嘿嘿，你觉得是什么？猜对的话，\n我也煮一份给{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1016_p", "source_sha256": "515efeebc067617b4821ee917d689638e2abc6ae6771d41b6637c2131b7a1693", "ja": "作ってあげる？\nという事は、食べ物か飲み物かな……。", "zh": "煮给我？\n这么说，可能是吃的或喝的啰……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "bf0bdb271246e516100dcf7fd3b1974a10a17cd15b1277b5e749a8e5b02432dd", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんすごい！\nえっとね、ヒントは……ポカポカする飲み物だよ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生真厉害！\n这个嘛，给你提示……是热呼呼的饮料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1018_p", "source_sha256": "016c29754802a7beb7b1bec6f899f4943e52be4b39676342acbdbff446a1a7e1", "ja": "ポカポカする飲み物……甘酒とかかな？", "zh": "热呼呼的饮料……是甜酒之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "5083a9502135ae280b07dc3d8752b1e14da52cb4be90166bdd6319734fd51478", "ja": "ブーッ、残念でした。\nえへへ、正解はショウガ湯だよ！", "zh": "噗噗～！答错了。\n嘿嘿，正确答案是姜汤喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "44360b1f05fcb3a4f09c74b0daaf4d75f42d3c43c21b308fa067d5f99b7d128f", "ja": "おかあさんが作って、水筒に入れてくれたの。\n{$P$}さんは、はずれちゃったけど。", "zh": "是妈妈煮好帮我装进水壶里的。\n虽然{$P$}先生没有猜对，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "14f9f28b301acf37ddbb16c789e8ecc25b5fb5ed902d8e05c451df16c12cd867", "ja": "でもすごくおいしいから、持ってきてあげる！\n{$P$}さん、ちょっと待っててね！", "zh": "但那个真的很好喝，我这就去拿来！\n{$P$}先生，等我一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "b75c20b0f9a631d8ca70396d97dc0cff424537a65e2a205128ea52cf90f3d001", "ja": "すごくあったまるし、\nファンのみんなにも、わけてあげたかったな～。", "zh": "这个喝下去真的很暖和。\n好想和粉丝一起分享～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0104_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d1ad4b499a470455aeacdb3c824554298e7528d7d4e175f3a4571f6bfcedb6b3", "ja": "（笑顔のまま、楽しそうに駆け出していく。育の\n温かい気持ちは、お客さん達にも届いただろう！）", "zh": "（育带着笑容，开心地往外跑了。\n相信她温暖的心意，一定也让观众感受到了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
